{"id": "224555", "name": "סכום גאומטרי ואחיד רציף – פונקציית ההתפלגות של Y = X + U", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>יהיו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X,U\\)</span> שני משתנים מקריים בלתי-תלויים כך ש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\sim\\mathsf{Geo}\\left(\\frac12\\right)\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\sim\\mathsf{U}\\left[-1,0\\right]\\)</span>. נסמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y=X+U\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מהי פונקציית ההתפלגות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F_Y\\)</span> של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\)</span>?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מתנים בערך של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span>: לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t\\)</span> רק ערך אחד של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span> נותן הסתברות חלקית.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הטווח</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\geq 1\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\in[-1,0]\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\geq 0\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F_Y(t)=0\\)</span> כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t\\lt 0\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — המקרה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t\\geq 0\\)</span></b><br>נסמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(k=\\lfloor t\\rfloor\\)</span>. אם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\leq k\\)</span> אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\leq X\\leq k\\leq t\\)</span>; אם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\geq k+2\\)</span> אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\geq k+1> t\\)</span>; ואם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X=k+1\\)</span> אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\leq t\\iff U\\leq t-k-1\\)</span>, וזה קורה בהסתברות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((t-k-1)-(-1)=t-k\\)</span>. לפי נוסחת ההסתברות השלמה ואי-התלות, עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}[X\\leq k]=1-2^{-k}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}[X=k+1]=2^{-k-1}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ F_Y(t) =\\begin{cases} 0 &amp; t \\lt 0 \\\\ 1-2^{-\\lfloor t \\rfloor}+2^{-\\lfloor t \\rfloor-1}\\left(t - \\lfloor t \\rfloor\\right) &amp; t \\geq 0 \\end{cases} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "checkbox", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "LaTeXdisplaystyle"}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "mcq_correct(ta)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["o1", "o2", "o3", "o4", "q", "ta"], "nvariants": 24}